WEBVTT

00:00:00.430 --> 00:00:06.510
In the name of the Father and of the Son and of the Holy Spirit, Amen.

00:00:06.510 --> 00:00:14.330
The reading from the Sinhaxadion for July 17th, on which we commemorate the Holy Great

00:00:14.330 --> 00:00:17.850
Margarina.

00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:25.730
The Holy Margarina lived during the reign of Emperor Claudius, circa 270.

00:00:25.730 --> 00:00:32.690
She was from Pesidian Antioch, and the daughter of the idolatrous priest Adesimus.

00:00:32.690 --> 00:00:39.070
Her mother, having died when she was 12 years old, she was placed in the care of a nurse

00:00:39.070 --> 00:00:42.610
who lived in the country.

00:00:42.610 --> 00:00:48.010
Association with Christians who lived in the area, along with the good natural disposition

00:00:48.010 --> 00:00:55.970
of the girl, made the seeds of the true faith germinate very quickly in her heart.

00:00:55.970 --> 00:01:03.090
When she had reached the age of 15, she was so consumed with love for Christ that she

00:01:03.090 --> 00:01:09.610
desired and thought about one single thing to commune by the shedding of her blood in

00:01:09.610 --> 00:01:15.490
the sacrifice that the martyrs made for the love of God.

00:01:15.490 --> 00:01:22.050
Apart from keeping this desire's secret, she had no fear of proclaiming aloud that she

00:01:22.050 --> 00:01:28.290
was a Christian, and she mocked the worship of idols.

00:01:28.290 --> 00:01:34.570
This provoked her father's hatred, and he disinherited her.

00:01:34.570 --> 00:01:41.850
Alibrius, prefect of Asia, being on the way to Antioch, met the saint while she was keeping

00:01:41.850 --> 00:01:45.930
the flocks with other women from the village.

00:01:45.930 --> 00:01:53.970
Charmed by her beauty, he told his men to bring her to him in order to make her his wife.

00:01:53.970 --> 00:02:00.850
Arriving at the palace and brought before the magistrate who asked her to identify herself,

00:02:00.850 --> 00:02:03.930
the girl declared with assurance.

00:02:03.930 --> 00:02:12.570
My name is Marina, the daughter of free-born parents in Pasidia, but I am a servant of our

00:02:12.570 --> 00:02:19.960
God and Savior, Jesus Christ, who made heaven and earth.

00:02:19.960 --> 00:02:26.020
She was put in prison till the next day on which a great pagan feast was due, taken

00:02:26.020 --> 00:02:32.660
again before the tribunal and urged to sacrifice to the gods with the rest of the people.

00:02:32.660 --> 00:02:41.000
Marina replied, I will offer a sacrifice of praise to my God, but never to your dumb

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:44.020
and lifeless idols.

00:02:44.020 --> 00:02:52.200
Alibrius pressed her to spare her youth and beauty, but she retorted that all carnal beauty

00:02:52.200 --> 00:03:01.260
fades, while torture endured in Christ's name adorns the soul and prepares it for the

00:03:01.260 --> 00:03:04.420
eternal marriage.

00:03:04.420 --> 00:03:11.860
The magistrate, angered by her audacity, ordered that she be stretched out on the ground and

00:03:11.860 --> 00:03:19.100
thrashed with thorny rods, and her flesh be lacerated with iron nails.

00:03:19.100 --> 00:03:27.580
The saints blood spurred out in a great flood and reddened the ground, but she let out not

00:03:27.580 --> 00:03:38.360
a single cry of pain, remaining imperturbable as though someone else were suffering in her place.

00:03:38.360 --> 00:03:44.800
After having tortured her in this way for hours, they returned her to prison.

00:03:44.800 --> 00:03:52.200
She was praying there to God not to abandon her in the trials and the confession of faith.

00:03:52.200 --> 00:03:59.320
In an earthquake shook the prison, bringing a monstrous dragon out of its layer.

00:03:59.320 --> 00:04:02.880
Fire and smoke belted from its eyes.

00:04:02.880 --> 00:04:10.000
Its tongue was blood-red, and it made a terrible whistling noise as it moved towards the

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:12.040
saint.

00:04:12.040 --> 00:04:19.680
Seized with great fear, Marina prayed to God the Savior who had reduced Satan to powerlessness

00:04:19.680 --> 00:04:23.920
and freed the dead from hell by his cross.

00:04:23.920 --> 00:04:29.920
The dragon changed itself into a huge and repulsive black dog.

00:04:29.920 --> 00:04:36.920
The saint thenceforth strengthened by the grace of God, grabbed it by the skin, and seizing

00:04:36.920 --> 00:04:45.120
hold of a hammer that was lying nearby, stopped the beast, placed her foot on its neck,

00:04:45.120 --> 00:04:50.800
and killed it, smiting it on the head and the spine.

00:04:50.800 --> 00:04:57.040
A brilliant light then appeared in the cell, shining from a huge cross on which a white

00:04:57.040 --> 00:04:59.400
dove was perched.

00:04:59.400 --> 00:05:09.680
The dove flew down beside Marina and said to her, rejoice, Marina, God's spiritual dove.

00:05:09.680 --> 00:05:16.200
For you have overcome the evil one, and covered him with shame.

00:05:16.200 --> 00:05:22.940
Rejoice, faithful servant of the God whom you love with all your heart, and for whom you

00:05:22.940 --> 00:05:27.960
have abandoned all the transient pleasures of the earth.

00:05:27.960 --> 00:05:35.040
Rejoice and be glad for the day has come for you to receive the crown of victory and to

00:05:35.040 --> 00:05:42.400
enter fittingly clad with the wise virgins into the nuptial chamber of your spouse and

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:44.680
your king.

00:05:44.680 --> 00:05:50.560
In the morning, Marina was summoned a second time before the governor's tribunal when she

00:05:50.560 --> 00:05:58.600
showed a resolution even firmer than before, a liberious, ordered that she be stripped, naked,

00:05:58.600 --> 00:06:01.960
and burned with torches.

00:06:01.960 --> 00:06:08.440
After this torture, she was thrown headfirst into a water-filled cistern.

00:06:08.440 --> 00:06:16.520
The dove then reappeared, bearing a branch in its beak, and the shining cross stood above

00:06:16.520 --> 00:06:23.440
the cistern, from which the saint emerged free of her bonds.

00:06:23.440 --> 00:06:31.520
The dove could be heard saying, come, Marina, and enjoy the rest reserved for the righteous.

00:06:32.520 --> 00:06:39.840
In the face of this miracle, a great many of the pagans present confessed Christ and asked

00:06:39.840 --> 00:06:44.480
the saint to instruct them in the doctrine of salvation.

00:06:44.480 --> 00:06:54.640
Beside himself with fury, the governor ordered that they all be beheaded, along with Marina.

00:06:54.640 --> 00:07:01.400
Arriving at the scaffold, Marina asked the executioners for a moment's prayer, and turning

00:07:01.400 --> 00:07:11.040
eastwards, she begged the Lord to give health of soul and body to all who asked her intercession.

00:07:11.040 --> 00:07:19.000
Having finished her prayer, she called on the executioner to do his work, but he, filled

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:28.640
with a devout fear, confessed Christ, and refused to lift his hand against the saint.

00:07:28.640 --> 00:07:35.440
Marina then said to him, you have no part in me, unless you get on with what you have

00:07:35.440 --> 00:07:43.600
been ordered to do, and with a trembling hand he beheaded her.

00:07:43.600 --> 00:07:51.400
A Christian called Theotimos, who had secretly carried food to the saint when she was in prison,

00:07:51.400 --> 00:07:56.480
took her body, and gave it worthy burial.

00:07:56.480 --> 00:08:04.440
Until the time of the Crusades, in the year 1204, the relics of Saint Marina were venerated

00:08:04.440 --> 00:08:11.240
in Constantinople, in the Church of Christ Pandepoptus.

00:08:11.240 --> 00:08:17.960
Through the prayers of our Holy Father's O Lord, Jesus Christ our God, have mercy on us

00:08:17.960 --> 00:08:18.960
and save us.
